 "diagnosis": "The invariant at line 100 (arr[j] == old(arr[j+1]) for j < i) is not maintained because the companion 'untouched' invariant only covers i <= j < capacity - 1, omitting the last element arr[capacity-1]. When i == capacity-2 the body copies arr[i+1] = arr[capacity-1], whose relation to old(arr[capacity-1]) is unknown, so arr[i] == old(arr[i+1]) cannot be proved. Fix: extend the untouched-range invariant to i <= j < capacity."}

